<http://data.silknow.org/object/9bcf0f61-dc57-3f57-97b4-366f29b8a29e/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Gaming purse of green silk velvet, lined with brocaded white silk taffeta. It is circular in shape with a wide circular base reinforced with pasteboard and shallow sides, pleated and pulled together with drawstrings of ⅞-inch (2.2 cm) wide pink silk ribbon, with 1 silver filé-covered tassel. It is couched with silver filé over linen thread in a pattern of repeating fleur-de-lys."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9bcf0f61-dc57-3f57-97b4-366f29b8a29e> .

